3.1 State definitions
State ID	State	Meaning	Entry condition	Exit condition
S-01	IDLE	Robot waits for work.	Startup or return to warehouse completed.	Valid delivery request or critical fault.
S-02	NAVIGATING	Robot travels to destination.	Valid delivery request accepted.	Obstacle, destination reached, low battery or fault.
S-03	AVOIDING_OBSTACLE	Robot handles an obstacle.	Obstacle detected during navigation.	Obstacle cleared or critical fault.
S-04	DELIVERING	Robot delivers the package.	Destination reached and delivery conditions satisfied.	Delivery completed or safety fault.
S-05	RETURNING	Robot travels to warehouse.	Delivery completed or delivery abandoned due to critical battery.	Warehouse reached or safety fault.
S-06	SAFE_MODE	Robot enters a safety-protection condition.	Critical battery, critical chamber temperature or other critical fault.	Fault cleared and recovery authorised.
S-07	LINK_LOST	Robot has lost its control link.	Communication timeout detected.	Link restored and communication integrity verified.
