3.2 Events and conditions
Event ID	Event	Meaning
E-01	PowerOn	Robot starts.
E-02	DeliveryRequest	A delivery request is received.
E-03	ObstacleDetected	An obstacle is detected.
E-04	ObstacleCleared	The obstacle is confirmed clear.
E-05	DestinationReached	Robot reaches the destination.
E-06	DeliveryCompleted	Package delivery is completed.
E-07	WarehouseReached	Robot arrives at the warehouse.
E-08	CriticalBattery	Battery falls below the emergency threshold.
E-09	CriticalTemperature	Chamber or battery temperature exceeds its critical threshold.
E-10	LinkTimeout	Communication link exceeds its allowed timeout.
E-11	LinkRestored	Communication link is restored and verified.
E-12	FaultCleared	The critical fault has been cleared and recovery is permitted.
